        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jonesborough%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The historic Chester Inn, built in 1797, now houses a museum that chronicles Jonesborough’s history from 1779 onward.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        12
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
